DASH.glossary.hl={m:"Breadth",d:"New highs = NYSE stocks at a 52-week high; new lows = at a 52-week low. Index up while lows still dominate = a narrow bounce. Latest session (Tue 10 Nov): 47 highs vs 116 lows (WSJ), worse than 57 vs 80 on Monday as hot CPI pushed the S&P down 0.38%. Lows have beaten highs on every session in our chart this month except 4 Nov, so the base is still weak; more highs than lows again would be the next sign of healing."};

